ncludes `action:trim_plants_and_remove` and correctly excludes `action:trim_plants_and_leave_cuttings`.\n\n**TUI** (actions.rs): Both variants have distinct form fields, labels (\"Trim & remove\" / \"Trim & leave\"), and contextual hints (\"exported\" / \"to detritus\").\n\n**Event messages**: Clearly distinguish the two cases in text.\n\n**Tests**: All acceptance criteria covered — unit tests for N/C export, N/C conservation, legacy migration, and a 500-hour integration test. All 200+ tests pass. Clippy clean.\n\nNo bugs, safety issues, or correctness gaps found."},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"a7c8acb8-005b-4ec4-afa8-4edc53400af6"}
